    },
    {
      "id": "11",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "若安装的是一键包（dr：参考语音，dt ：参考语音的文本，dl ：语言）：",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "12",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\nruntime\\python.exe api.py -dr \"111.wav\" -dt \"\" -dl \"zh\"  \n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "13",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "若直接正常手动安装（dr：参考语音，dt ：参考语音的文本，dl ：语言）：\n",
      "type": "block docx-text-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "14",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "\n代码块\nPlain Text\n复制\npython api.py -dr \"111.wav\" -dt \"\" -dl \"zh\"  \n",
      "type": "block docx-code-block"
    },
    {
      "id": "15",
      "images": 0,
      "links": [],
      "text": "其他参数若想自定义，可以查看api.py了解，自行配置",
